  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>500</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>499</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>498</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>500</mn></msup></math></p><p>Using sum of the G.P in the given expression we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>500</mn></msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mn>501</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mfenced><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>501</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>501</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>501</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>501</mn></msup><mn>5</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Now coefficient of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>101</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>501</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;will be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>101</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>501</mn></mmultiscripts></mfenced><msup><mfenced><mn>5</mn></mfenced><mrow><mn>501</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>101</mn></mrow></msup></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>5</mn><mn>399</mn></msup><mfenced><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>101</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>501</mn></mmultiscripts></mfenced></math></p>"
